            <string>How the cuts are distributed across the span. Linear spaces them evenly; Ease In and Exponential bunch them toward the start; Ease Out and Smooth Step bunch them toward the end; Ease In-Out bunches them at both ends and thins the middle; Weighted takes its direction and strength from Bias.</string>
           </property>
